        "original_id": "99497f98-0bbc-5b7b-a811-d8bd6b53a2c9",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Hakan Şükür, Robbie Keane, Christian Vieri, Ronaldo\n- Organizations: Inter Milan, Republic of Ireland national team\n- Roles: Scorers, Captain\n- Events: 2000–01 Inter Milan season, Robbie Keane's international retirement\n\nFacts:\n- During the 2000–01 Inter Milan season, Inter Milan relied on Hakan Şükür and Robbie Keane for scoring while waiting for Christian Vieri to recover and for Ronaldo to return.\n- From March 2006 until his international retirement in August 2016, Robbie Keane served as captain of the Republic of Ireland national team.",
